    "description": "Enjoy a calming and relax experience of anime coloring pictures you like.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udc81\u200d\u2640\ufe0fHOW TO COLOR\ud83d\udc81\u200d\u2640\ufe0f\r\nJust tap to follow the pattern and reveal a colorful masterpiece created by yourself.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udc97WHAT TO COLOR\ud83d\udc97\r\n\ud83c\udf08Trending Anime\r\n\ud83c\udf08Trending Game\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udf39WHAT DO WE OFFER\ud83c\udf39\r\n\ud83d\udc4f Simple and succinct: Color Fan is designed with clean functions. You will enjoy the coloring experience without distractions. \r\n\ud83d\udc4f Exquisite and exclusive pictures: Enjoy diverse categories of exclusive pictures in Color Fan.\r\n\ud83d\udc4f Connect with your friend and family: Share pictures and playback videos with your friends and families with only one click.\r\n\r\nWelcome to Color Fan! Relax and entertain yourself while taking a short break.\r\n\r\nYour suggestions and feedback are of great value to us. Please share your thoughts with us: support@colorfan.freshdesk.com\r\n\r\nPrivacy Policy:  https://www.icolor.app/privacy.html\r\nTerms of Use: https://www.icolor.app/service.html",
